r of $Δ$.*"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186198588 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "de3fa2fa-304c-583a-8c73-a5ff1db972e2" :knowledge-point/title "Finding a Transformation That Maps a Rectangular Region Onto a Given One"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9de898ca-f275-5cd4-9ec3-50dfbb539dff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{uv}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186194130} {:answer/id #uuid "a8d44885-decf-580a-84ea-8fbdeff2cff9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{\\frac{v}{u}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186194131} {:answer/id #uuid "b5d3b428-2c31-5423-8491-e4f98ea25303" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "uv" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186194132} {:answer/id #uuid "110532ce-a9e3-5bb5-8aa8-502f6f717961" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{u}{v}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186194133} {:answer/id #uuid "24c330e5-9b44-577d-b85a-3ff91e5c25ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{\\frac{u}{v}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186194134}] :answer-field/id #uuid "2ec90679-7ec5-5181-8643-eeea485fc9f6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186194129}] :question/id #uuid "f0c60c12-3acb-5c5a-8aba-c02d0db96c2a" :question/math-academy-id "q-160559" :question/problem "Consider the finite region $D$ enclosed in the first quadrant of the $xy$-plane between the curves\n$y = x, y = 3x, y = \\frac{1}{x}, y = \\frac{5}{x}$.\n\nA transformation $T$, where\n\n$T: (u, v) → (x(u, v), y(u, v))$,\n\nmaps a rectangular region $Δ$ with sides parallel to the $u$- and $v$-axes from the $uv$-plane onto $D$ in the $xy$-plane. Given that\n$T: (u, v) → (\\sqrt{\\frac{v}{u}}, A A)$,\nwhat could be the missing expression?"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129515 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "091b8235-56d8-5a08-bc95-08c99772cfd8" :knowledge-point/title "Finding 